1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,255
W: I'm terribly sorry, Henry, but I am going to have to cancel the meeting tonight.

2
00:00:05,295 --> 00:00:14,495
I just received a call from Mr. King, a very important client of mine, and he says that he is in the area and he wants to come over to the office at 6 to talk to me about something.

3
00:00:15,015 --> 00:00:17,075
Do you think we can get together another time?

4
00:00:17,095 --> 00:00:19,295
M: Sure, we can always catch a flick this weekend.

5
00:00:20,055 --> 00:00:21,655
Who is this Mr. King guy anyway?

6
00:00:22,115 --> 00:00:27,015
W: Oh, he is the owner of a fabric manufacturing firm that I recently sold a group policy to.

7
00:00:27,695 --> 00:00:31,135
He mentioned something about wanting to increase the size of his group policy.

8
00:00:31,455 --> 00:00:32,775
M: Wow, that's great.

9
00:00:33,135 --> 00:00:36,915
I wish more of my customers would come and visit me to buy extra coverage.
